\newlabel{fig:remedies}{{3}{6}{\textbf {Error on new plans for every model and remedy} (0 means the predicted change in sales is right). Medians over the 12 worlds of each shape. Filled: trained on the merchants' history; open: with 5\% random test plans. Rows after the first in each block, and the split rows, were added after the first results}{figure.caption.22}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Every model and remedy in the three worlds.} Medians over the 12 worlds of each kind (four planning strengths, three seeds). Forecast: item-by-store RMSSE on the merchants' own plan in the held-out weeks. New plans: mean over the eight held-out plans of $|\log (\text  {predicted change}/\text  {true change})|$. Price choice: revenue given up by the regular-price move the model picks, \% of the best. Stock: summed absolute error of ordering to the forecast, over expected sales. Rows marked + change one thing in the row above; all rows after the first of each model, and the split rows, were added after the first results (Appendix~\ref {app:plan}). The kinked world was run for the versions shown.}}{7}{table.caption.23}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:remedies}{{2}{7}{\textbf {Every model and remedy in the three worlds.} Medians over the 12 worlds of each kind (four planning strengths, three seeds). Forecast: item-by-store RMSSE on the merchants' own plan in the held-out weeks. New plans: mean over the eight held-out plans of $|\log (\text {predicted change}/\text {true change})|$. Price choice: revenue given up by the regular-price move the model picks, \% of the best. Stock: summed absolute error of ordering to the forecast, over expected sales. Rows marked + change one thing in the row above; all rows after the first of each model, and the split rows, were added after the first results (Appendix~\ref {app:plan}). The kinked world was run for the versions shown}{table.caption.23}{}}
